# 逆転裁判 (Gyakuten Saiban, AGB-ASBJ): the game's own numbers for its characters, as the script has them
# (16-bit, the low byte first, so 00C0 is written C000). Each was read in play: the words of a page the game
# was showing beside the characters on screen; the kana not met are filled in by their order, which every kana
# met keeps (hiragana from 00C0, katakana from 0110). A number not here comes out as U+FFFD.
